<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BRE Properties cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BRE Properties cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has cut its rating on BRE Properties Inc to hold from buy, a source at the brokerage said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- BRE's stock closed at 22-1/2 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
